41880996650690", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12602285_430315587308033_2710869523421986816_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9PyGoEoOKdwQ7kNvwFxwLnU&_nc_oc=AdoCws5bKm13qb9hgjpvQ8-YEw5t8y5u8v2avLzXlM9WYTjCjcF8Hh9G8M1WyKwpLIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQlBeRd7eHBJiT3MhX3DAmubKYoEpDaSzHi20rPI5lPA&oe=6B09B8AD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "565521627392598", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331199_254852041592663_5116647445131952128_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vRWZGtzSHqAQ7kNvwFM4crA&_nc_oc=AdpThKo46nUsD7OqNVsSvISo2yA9iEQ2zpu1b2suVCET_gPP-3A2BlODWboPpuEk26g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTHoMCG65FsgpOMN4zDQ0HgF9H60GY7e9s2vzVOV35VEg&oe=6B09AA99"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "500607237290868", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139051_383583982013500_2105011403604623360_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jKYliSLL9bAQ7kNvwHo43o1&_nc_oc=Adpcvz0HyK79MuB7qAZJMB8xJIlfWd_oFPKiJBSh_Q7rwknI2gpuPJZfCnU4W8DjzLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWnc39_DBehU-pNyda_T5PU_AW-4CaMu68D-xGsVF8fg&oe=6B09AD11"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rock & Rails", "keywords": ["Rock", "Rails", "Shooter", "Music", "Cooperative"], "long_description": "The world of Rock \u2018n\u2019 Roll has been silenced, so it\u2019s time to get loud! Take up guitars and basses, and blow up the Silence Beasts with a BAAANG! Ride on rails all over the city, shredding riffs solo or jamming with your friends, and reclaim our world back in the name of Rock!\n\n- 9 levels full of rock and metal\n- 3 eligible characters\n- Metal Mode - harder levels for hard rockers\n- Local Co-Op Mode - jam with a friend*\n\n* Requires two devices with the game installed and a WiFi connection to play in co-op mode.", "short_description": "The world of Rock \u2018n\u2019 Roll has been silenced, so it\u2019s time to get loud! Take up guitars and basses, and blow up the Silence Beasts with a BAAANG! Fly over the place shredding riffs solo or jamming with your friends, and reclaim our world back in the name of Rock!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "248799673186091", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rock & Rails", "keywords": ["Rock", "Rieles", "Disparos", "Musica", "Multijugador"], "long_description": "El mundo del rock fue silenciado. \u00a1Es hora de subir el volumen y cambiarlo! Toma tu guitarra y bajo, y destruye a las Bestias del Silencio con un sonoro estruendo. Desliza por rieles que llevan a todo tipo de lugar, ya sea solo o tocando con amigos, \u00a1y reclama nuestro mundo de vuelta en el nombre del Rock!\n\n- 9 niveles llenos de rock y metal\n- 3 personajes elegibles\n- Modo Metal - niveles m\u00e1s dificiles para rockeros hardcore\n- Modo Cooperativo Local - juega con un amigo*\n\n* Requiere dos tel\u00e9fonos con el juego instalado y una conexi\u00f3n WiFi para jugar en modo cooperativo.", "short_description": "El mundo del rock fue silenciado. \u00a1Es hora de subir el volumen y cambiarlo! Toma tu guitarra y bajo, y destruye a las Bestias del Silencio con un sonoro estruendo. Desliza por rieles que llevan a todo tipo de lugar, ya sea solo o tocando con amigos, \u00a1y reclama nuestro mundo de vuelta en el nombre del Rock!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://blackriverstudios.net/docs/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://blackriverstudios.net/docs/privacy-policy.html", "publisher_name": "Black River Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://blackriverstudios.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "cont